      "ja": "• FSDとは「Full Scale Development」の略語で「先行量産」を意味し、特徴的な腕部ガトリング、特殊な形状の胸部や印象的なシールドは新規で再現されている！",
      "en": "• FSD is an abbreviation of \"Full Scale Development \" and means \" advance mass production\", and the characteristic arm gatling, special shaped chest and impressive seal have been newly reproduced!"
